  "title": "SUMX2PY2 and SUMXMY2 check shape mismatch (#N/A) before array error cells and round per binary64 term",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527, SUMX2PY2 and SUMXMY2 validate paired singleton arguments and array shape equality (#N/A) before reading error cells inside mismatched arrays (so SUMX2PY2({#VALUE!;1},{1;2;3}) returns #N/A), skip positions where either entry is text, logical, or blank (returning #DIV/0! if no position has two numbers), and accumulate binary64 terms x*x + y*y or (x - y)*(x - y), differing by up to 0.66 ULP from the exact mathematical value on rounding boundaries.",
  "status": "measured",
